    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef soft_threshold(values, t):\n    z = np.array(values, dtype=float)\n    return (np.sign(z) * np.maximum(np.abs(z) - t, 0)).round(4).tolist()\n\nprint(soft_threshold([3.0, -0.5, 0.2, -2.0], 1.0))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np\n\n\ndef soft_threshold(values, t):\n    z = np.array(values, dtype=float)\n    return (np.sign(z) * np.maximum(np.abs(z) - t, 0)).round(4).tolist()\n\nprint(soft_threshold([3.0, -0.5, 0.2, -2.0], 1.0))\n```"
    }
